        "id": 1002361
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-05-13T13:10:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I assume these are coming from https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/blob/main/LICENSE.TXT\n\nMost of these licenses do not apply to our usage of DXC. For example, the GPL license is for `autoconf/config.guess`, which we don\u0027t use.",
      "parentUuid": "2f6dc661_9a9301f5",
      "revId": "77e885dcb126a5da1880171d321b0a0552fee084",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "af8bbca5_08804fae",
        "filename": "third_party/directx-shader-compiler/README.chromium",
