        "id": 4240850
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-02T01:29:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "All of these are on the license allow list so it doesn\u0027t hurt to include them. The GPL2 is with the autoconf exception which is fine. Keeping the metadata in sync with what\u0027s included in the license file reduces uncertainty, and reduces the chance of something restricted sneaking in.\n\nIf this was vendored in (instead of DEPS), and had a restricted license then I would suggest removing the parts that are restricted.",
      "parentUuid": "031692ea_7f96da5f",
      "revId": "77e885dcb126a5da1880171d321b0a0552fee084",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    }
